# Always deploy at the end

When a user-facing change is finished in this repo:

1. Commit the relevant files (unless the user said not to commit).
2. Push to `main` so Vercel Production deploys.
3. Confirm the Vercel/GitHub deploy status before ending.
4. Do not wait for the user to ask «Задеплоил?» — deploy is part of finishing the task.

Exceptions: pure local experiments the user asked not to ship, or when they explicitly say not to deploy.
